MintCurveConvexPosition::multicall(bytes[])
├── given the batch contains a call to an onlyOwnerOrAuthorized function
│   ├── given caller is not owner and not authorized spender
│   │   └── it should revert with MintCurveConvexPositionUnauthorized
│   ├── given caller is the owner
│   │   ├── it should preserve msg.sender as the owner across each delegatecall
│   │   └── it should execute every batched call
│   └── given caller is an authorized spender and not owner
│       ├── it should preserve msg.sender as the authorized spender across each delegatecall
│       └── it should execute every batched call
├── given the batch mixes multiple onlyOwnerOrAuthorized functions
│   └── given caller is owner or authorized spender
│       ├── it should execute all batched calls in order
│       └── it should return the encoded results for each call
├── when one call in the batch reverts
│   └── it should revert the entire batch
└── when the batch is empty
    └── it should succeed and return an empty results array
